ap in the exact sequence.\nRepeat with the cokernel to get the second. Some details omitted.\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\nProof of (1) <MATH_0019> (2). This is true because if <MATH_0020> is quasi-affine\nthen <MATH_0021> is an ample invertible module, see\nProperties, Lemma <REF_0006>.\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\nWe omit the proof of (4) <MATH_0022> (3).\n<STRUCT_0010>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2a7db3ef375e2d65b57ff5f16226ed5b47e7c7fb281f9e3ab3b8d9554368e7c0", "unit_id": "inventory:algebraization:0EK2:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:fb7b8bb07f7adc803d1666cf4d722416164d66178b8aaba2767ea10529fc6a0c", "hash": "sha256:fb7b8bb07f7adc803d1666cf4d722416164d66178b8aaba2767ea10529fc6a0c", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 184954, "byte_start": 184329, "file": "algebraization.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:a99bd52961b3e6123d66dd0f4788ca79debc48625c2f27fc0a13e180ba8630f5", "line_end": 4741, "line_start": 4730}, "owner_tag": "0EIQ", "parent_tag": "0EKN", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "algebraization", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0EKN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\mathcal{G}_n)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\textit{Coh}(X, \\mathcal{I})$", "MATH_0004": "$\\alpha$", "MATH_0005": "$(\\mathcal{F}_n)$", "MATH_0006": "$(\\mathcal{G}_n)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\alpha_n : \\mathcal{F}_{m(n)} \\to \\mathcal{G}_n$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathbf{N} \\to \\mathbf{N}$", "MATH_0009": "$n \\mapsto m(n)$", "MATH_0010": "$m(n) \\geq n$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{F}_n = \\mathcal{F}_{m(n)}/\\mathcal{I}^n\\mathcal{F}_{m(n)}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{G}_n$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{I}^n$", "MATH_0014": "$\\alpha_n$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{F}_n \\to \\mathcal{G}_n$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afce